From 325a37ee6f8a7036c90f995fab3136b550088ebb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AzediZ <145237384+AzediZ@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 20:06:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Cynos, jump drives and jump portals: jump checks, covert
 cynos, titan and black ops bridges

Jump drive (CmdBeaconJumpFleet / CmdBeaconJumpAlliance): the beacon is looked up again
before it is used (no crash when the cyno went out after the client cached it), the cyno's
pilot must be in the jumper's fleet, range is checked against jumpDriveRange,
jumpDriveCapacitorNeed x capacitorCapacity is taken from the capacitor, and fuel is taken
correctly across several stacks (every stack smaller than the cost used to be deleted).
Only black ops may jump to a covert field.

Cynos: the Covert Cynosural Field Generator group gets CynoModule (a Covert Cynosural
Field I is spawned; cyno jammers don't stop it), so it can be fitted. Survey no longer
lengthens the cycle. The ship is stopped as well as frozen when the field is lit. The pilot
is looked up when the module is activated instead of when it is loaded.

Fleet members who join after a cyno is lit or a portal opened are sent OnJumpBeaconChange
and OnBridgeModeChange for them, on join (FleetService::AddMember) and on GetInitState.

Jump portals: JumpPortalModule for the Jump Portal Generator group. The new
CmdBridgeToMember and CmdBridgeToStructure open a one-cycle portal: range checked against
the portal ship's jumpDriveRange, ship stopped and frozen, OnBridgeModeChange sent to the
fleet (and false when it closes). The module button refuses to activate on its own.
CmdJumpThroughFleet jumps a fleet member within 2500 m (surface to surface) of the portal
ship, taking mass x jumpPortalConsumptionMassFactor x light years of the portal ship's fuel
from its fuel bay. Covert portals take covert ops, stealth bombers and force recons only;
other portals refuse capitals, black ops and freighters. CmdJumpThroughAlliance replies
that it isn't supported yet.

Shared checks and helpers are in ship/JumpDrive.cpp.
